"say": "ORDER BY time DESC is the only ORDER BY allowed. =~ matches a regular expression: both labs, one timestamp.",
"sql": "SELECT temp_c, co2_ppm FROM room_env WHERE room = 'lab_2' ORDER BY time DESC LIMIT 3\nSELECT temp_c, co2_ppm FROM room_env WHERE room =~ /^lab/ AND time = '2026-02-02T10:00:00Z'",
